{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>An American provincial town has seen better days. Now it slowly withers away, shrouded in fog and surrounded by endless fields. Time feels frozen, and it seems nothing can awaken life in Riverwood. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/8d63c8a6ef7e696d169b98a517dd0e6b.avif?t=1768154613\" width=600 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a group of teenagers discovers a strange, unmarked VHS tape. Driven by curiosity, they decide to watch it, which sets off a chain of terrifying events. The tape seeps into their minds, turning their deepest fears into reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/55456408919d64da63294a68a7ae6881.poster.avif?t=1768154613\" width=1138 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/55456408919d64da63294a68a7ae6881.webm?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to uncover the origin of the cassette and escape the nightmare before it\u2019s too late.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/0297e69cf23a3baf61ac7bc29691de4c.poster.avif?t=1768154613\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/0297e69cf23a3baf61ac7bc29691de4c.webm?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/0297e69cf23a3baf61ac7bc29691de4c.mp4?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Try to help the characters survive \u2014 or lead them to ruin. The story will go on either way, but the ending may be hopeful... or not. It all depends on your choices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/ed85fc031a342f66c9c1dd97fb01efcb.poster.avif?t=1768154613\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/ed85fc031a342f66c9c1dd97fb01efcb.webm?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/ed85fc031a342f66c9c1dd97fb01efcb.mp4?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also influence the relationships between characters by making moral choices.<strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Game features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hundreds of hand-painted frames with animated characters and environments, creating a cinematic storytelling experience;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The ability to influence the story and shape the fate of the main characters;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Nonlinear, branching narrative with multiple paths and outcomes;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A haunting original soundtrack that immerses you in an atmosphere of horror and mystery;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Interactive elements and mini-games that expand the traditional visual novel experience;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 90s retro aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The first of the planned episodes will be released in 2026. In total, we aim to release five episodes, each taking you deeper into new layers of horror. </strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Content Notes</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains psychologically intense themes, stylized horror elements, and some scenes of heightened violence. It includes  depictions of suicide, injuries, blood, death, disturbing situations, and emotionally heavy moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does <i>not</i> contain sexual violence, sexual content, BDSM.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2885810?t=1768154613","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768154613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768154613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768154613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3045840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>An American provincial town has seen better days. Now it slowly withers away, shrouded in fog and surrounded by endless fields. Time feels frozen, and it seems nothing can awaken life in Riverwood. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/8d63c8a6ef7e696d169b98a517dd0e6b.avif?t=1768154613\" width=600 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a group of teenagers discovers a strange, unmarked VHS tape. Driven by curiosity, they decide to watch it, which sets off a chain of terrifying events. The tape seeps into their minds, turning their deepest fears into reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/55456408919d64da63294a68a7ae6881.poster.avif?t=1768154613\" width=1138 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/55456408919d64da63294a68a7ae6881.webm?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to uncover the origin of the cassette and escape the nightmare before it\u2019s too late.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/0297e69cf23a3baf61ac7bc29691de4c.poster.avif?t=1768154613\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/0297e69cf23a3baf61ac7bc29691de4c.webm?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/0297e69cf23a3baf61ac7bc29691de4c.mp4?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Try to help the characters survive \u2014 or lead them to ruin. The story will go on either way, but the ending may be hopeful... or not. It all depends on your choices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/ed85fc031a342f66c9c1dd97fb01efcb.poster.avif?t=1768154613\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/ed85fc031a342f66c9c1dd97fb01efcb.webm?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/extras/ed85fc031a342f66c9c1dd97fb01efcb.mp4?t=1768154613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also influence the relationships between characters by making moral choices.<strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Game features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hundreds of hand-painted frames with animated characters and environments, creating a cinematic storytelling experience;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The ability to influence the story and shape the fate of the main characters;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Nonlinear, branching narrative with multiple paths and outcomes;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A haunting original soundtrack that immerses you in an atmosphere of horror and mystery;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Interactive elements and mini-games that expand the traditional visual novel experience;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 90s retro aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The first of the planned episodes will be released in 2026. In total, we aim to release five episodes, each taking you deeper into new layers of horror. </strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Content Notes</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains psychologically intense themes, stylized horror elements, and some scenes of heightened violence. It includes  depictions of suicide, injuries, blood, death, disturbing situations, and emotionally heavy moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does <i>not</i> contain sexual violence, sexual content, BDSM.</p>","developers":["Somber Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/header.jpg?t=1768154613","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2885810/2144964343/962ffcd18e7098eccb9561b06de7433ecc09f411/1754852012/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754854266