5e71ab4dcb98a486818087486d/ss_402a3764d333935e71ab4dcb98a486818087486d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768154613","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/402a3764d333935e71ab4dcb98a486818087486d/ss_402a3764d333935e71ab4dcb98a486818087486d.600x338.jpg?t=1768154613"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/1734e616db585c2b44f845715320921799aecbec/ss_1734e616db585c2b44f845715320921799aecbec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768154613","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885810/1734e616db585c2b44f845715320921799aecbec/ss_1734e616db585c2b44f845715320921799aecbec.600x338.jpg?t=1768154613"}],"short_description":"Pink Noise is a nonlinear visual novel in the psychological horror genre, immersing you in the retro atmosphere of the '90s. It tells the tale of a group of teenagers who unknowingly set off a chain of terrifying events. What secrets lie within the mysterious VHS tape they should\u2019ve never played?","steam_appid":2885810,"support_info":{"email":"sombergamesstudio@gmail.com","url":"https://www.sombergames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.sombergames.com/"}